 and every pair is released.\n\n### Conditions\n\n- **Single-phase ESA power modules:** the ESA EMEA datasheet names the G20 battery modules for these power modules; the G21 variants are not in that table.\n- **Three-phase ESA power modules:** the ESA datasheet lists the G20 battery modules, and the user manual caps a battery column at a maximum count of modules and names a battery expansion kit for higher capacity.\n\nApproved partner accounts see net prices; the cards show them after sign-in.", "refs": ["6523", "6524", "6525", "6526", "6527", "6528", "6513", "6512", "3583", "3556", "6514", "3584"]}, {"type": "cards", "product_ids": [6523, 6524, 6525, 6526, 6527, 6528, 6513, 6512, 3583, 3556, 6514, 3584], "prices": [{"product_id": 6523, "text": "Net price after partner sign-in", "reason": "login"}, {"product_id": 6524, "text": "Net price after partner sign-in", "reason": "login"}, {"product_id": 6525, "text": "Net price after partner sign-in", "reason": "login"}, {"product_id": 6526, "text": "Net price after partner sign-in", "reason": "login"}, {"product_id": 6527, "text": "Net price after partner sign-in", "reason": "login"}, {"product_id": 6528, "text": "Net price after partner sign-in", "reason": "login"}, {"product_id": 6513, "text": "Net price after partner sign-in", "reason": "login"}, {"product_id": 6512, "text": "Net price after partner sign-in", "reason": "login"}, {"product_id": 3583, "text": "Net price after partner sign-in", "reason": "login"}, {"product_id": 3556, "text": "Net price after partner sign-in", "reason": "login"}, {"product_id": 6514, "text": "Net price after partner sign-in", "reason": "login"}, {"product_id": 3584, "text": "Net price after partner sign-in", "reason": "login"}]}, {"type": "ask", "field": "phase", "options": ["Single-phase", "Three-phase"]}], "wp": "http://127.0.0.1:9177"}
{"id": "b10-de", "slot": 10, "lang": "de", "category": "pairing", "assertion": "deterministic", "hard": false, "trial": null, "question": "Mit welchen Wechselrichtern funktioniert die Batterie GW9.0-BAT-D-G20?", "page": {"type": "other"}, "seconds": 23.7, "timing": {"understand": 11.437, "understand.vocabulary": 0.0, "understand.attachments": 0.0, "understand.jev": 11.164, "understand.call.linker/search-products": 0.269, "understand.calls": 0.27, "model.tool.linker/get-product": 0.232, "model.tool.linker/search-products": 0.636, "model.attempt_1": 11.956, "model": 11.956, "ground": 0.001, "hydrate": 0.0, "log": 0.004, "first_event": 23.401, "total": 23.401}, "verdict": "pass", "failures": [], "meta": {"turn_id": 363, "grounded": true, "fallback": false, "attempts": 1, "failures": [], "language": "de", "route": "products", "intent": "pairing_compatibility", "jev_error": null, "timing": {"understand": 11.437, "understand.vocabulary": 0.0, "understand.attachments": 0.0, "understand.jev": 11.164, "understand.call.linker/search-products": 0.269, "understand.calls": 0.27, "model.tool.linker/get-product": 0.232, "model.tool.linker/search-products": 0.636, "model.attempt_1": 11.956, "model": 11.956, "ground": 0.001, "hydrate": 0.0, "log": 0.004, "first_event": 23.401, "total": 23.401}}, "answer": "Für diese Batterie sind die ESA-Leistungsmodule von GoodWe als dokumentiertes Pairing freigegeben, einphasig wie dreiphasig. Die Bedingungen aus den Pairing-Unterlagen:\n\n### Einphasige Leistungsmodule\nDas GoodWe-Datenblatt ESA (EMEA) nennt die G20-Batteriemodule für die Leistungsmodule GW3K- bis GW10K-EHA-G20; die G21-Varianten stehen nicht in dieser Tabelle.\n\n### Dreiphasige Leistungsmodule\nDas ESA-Datenblatt nennt die G20-Module, und das Benutzerhandbuch begrenzt eine Batteriesäule und nennt ein Batterie-Erweiterungsset für mehr Kapazität oder eine niedrigere Säule.\n\nFreigegebene Partnerkonten sehen die Nettopreise in den Produktkarten.", "blocks": [{"type": "text", "tex